  "label": "Visual Metaphor",
  "description": "The meme uses a visual metaphor — the globe surrounded by figures — to represent abstract ideas. In real-world communication, visual metaphors are a powerful tool for conveying complex messages quickly and emotionally. The image suggests that global unity is built on the collective awesomeness of individual contributions. Understanding this requires knowledge of how visual metaphors function in art, advertising, and social media to communicate ideas beyond literal representation.",
